    "_comments": [
      "bizapps-sales#273: the deal's Stage history grid had no DefaultInView field, so MJ showed the",
      "first ten fields: the deal, stage, status and user IDs. A rep reads a stage change as when, from",
      "which stage and status to which, who made it, how long the deal sat in the previous stage, and the",
      "amount at that point. The view already carries the name columns; these eight are the grid.",
      "",
      "AutoUpdateDefaultInView is off so CodeGen's field analysis does not re-pick the columns when a",
      "field is added to this entity. The ID columns stay available from the grid's column chooser."
